      "seed": 496407736,
      "version": 275,
      "versionNonce": 1497690808,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788623527508,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Collision Domain: \n- L2 (switches, bridges) and L3 (routers) isolate collisions: each \nconnected port is its own separate collision domain.\n- Layer 1 devices (hubs, repeaters) cannot isolate collisions: all \ndevices plugged into a hub share one single collision domain.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iJWJNIixEG0UWKRf5vwZn",
      "originalText": "Collision Domain: \n- L2 (switches, bridges) and L3 (routers) isolate collisions: each connected port is its own separate collision domain.\n- Layer 1 devices (hubs, repeaters) cannot isolate collisions: all devices plugged into a hub share one single collision domain.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
